      <li><a href="#what">What is the Vibe Dashboard</a></li>
      <li><a href="#start">How to Start It</a></li>
      <li><a href="#tabs">Dashboard Tabs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cli">CLI Alternatives</a></li>
      <li><a href="#data-flow">Data Flow</a></li>
      <li><a href="#production">Production Build</a></li>
      <li><a href="#troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</a></li>
    </ol>
